Snipe-IT API description (not covered by the MIT License)
---------------------------------------------------------
vendor/snipe-it-rest-api.json is the OpenAPI description of the Snipe-IT
REST API as published by the Snipe-IT API documentation
(https://snipe-it.readme.io, downloaded from
https://snipe-it.readme.io/openapi/snipe-it-rest-api.json by
scripts/refresh-spec.sh, which only removes the documentation explorer's
Authorization header entries). The file itself states no license, and
this project has not verified under which terms it is published. It is
included only for interoperability: the code generator reads it to
build tools that call the Snipe-IT REST API. It is NOT licensed under
the MIT License of this project, and no rights in it are granted by this
repository; all rights remain with their owners.

Tool names, titles, descriptions and parameter descriptions of the
generated tools (src/tools/generated, and dist/tools/generated in the
npm package) are derived from that description.

